magic: the masters have set a new rule for every student, and it cuts across the year {N} had planned
scene: A notice has gone up at {clash.setting}, signed by {clash.holder}: {clash.demand}. There will be no exceptions this year. It cuts across the one part of school {N} was looking forward to, and a whole year now looks different.
scene tribal: The elders have set the young their tasks for the year, and the word from {clash.holder} is this: {clash.demand}. It cuts across what {N} wanted to learn, and it is settled.
scene magic: The masters of {clash.setting} have posted the year's rule for every student, and {clash.holder} has said it plainly: {clash.demand}. The year {N} hoped for is not in it.
- W | ask through the proper channels to move to another school | v: conformity, achievement | clash: leave | foot: means ties-.03 | chance: 55
- U | spend the free periods in the library, with others who feel the same | v: self-direction, achievement | clash: own_scene | foot: place learn.keeping | chance: 75
- B | offer a deal: top marks all year, for one exception of your choosing | v: achievement, power | clash: bridge | foot: door kept your word | chance: 50
- R | stand up in assembly and say the new line is wrong | v: stimulation, self-direction | clash: confront | foot: mark defied an authority | chance: 40
- G | go along with it this year, as {sibling} did before | v: tradition, security | clash: give_in | foot: means freedom-.03 | chance: 90
- W>B | ask {clash.ally} to put your case to {clash.holder}, with your marks to back it | v: conformity, achievement | clash: bridge | foot: person mentor | chance: 55
- U>R | bring the numbers: how many it affects, and what it costs them | v: self-direction, stimulation | clash: confront | foot: lesson facts carry weight sometimes | chance: 50
- B>G | do what the notice asks, every day of term | v: achievement, security | clash: give_in | foot: mark kept your word | chance: 85
- R>W | ask {parent} for a year out at sixteen, to work out what you want | v: stimulation, conformity | clash: leave | foot: means freedom+.06 | chance: 50
- G>U | join the after-school nature group, where your questions are welcome | v: benevolence, self-direction | clash: own_scene | foot: place gather.circle; person friend | chance: 75
works: The line stays, with one exception made for {N} after a long talk. It is not what {N} wanted, and it is something.
works: {N} gets the change, a term late and with a pile of catching up to do.
fails: The line stays as it is, and {N} spends the year living with it.
fails: It half works: {clash.holder} agrees to look again next year, and this year is gone.

