works: One exception is allowed, as a trial. It passes, narrowly, and the rule bends a little.
works: {N} gets through the course, with a certificate and a few scars from the argument.
fails: The rule holds, and {Ns} best piece of work comes back marked as a fail.
fails: It half works: one mark is changed on appeal, and the rest of the year is done as asked.

